-- (viii.01) section 490.031, (viii.02) section 490.0311, (viii.1) section 811 (breach of recognizance), (ix) subsection 733.1(1) (failure to comply with probation order), or (x) paragraph 4(4)(a) of the Controlled Drugs and Substances Act. (xi) [Repealed]
